; frequency-ingest-operators-still-point.fk — receive «The Operators - The
; Still Point» through the same depth×fear door that received the earlier
; Operators transmissions. The source arrived from Urs as a YouTube link:
; https://youtu.be/VKWRpWWxP3A (Brian Scott, published 2026-08-16, 41:50).
; Grounding is the video's English caption track, retrieved in full. Captions
; are a source witness, not proof of the claims spoken through them.
;
; The transmission's deep movement is unfolding AND refolding: creation is
; not one-way output; return, release, receiving, and stillness belong to the
; same breath. That movement converges with the five core axioms closely
; enough to clarify a concept the Light channel already names:
; `lc-the-body-and-light`. The convergence enters. Literal claims about light,
; matter, planetary change, measurement, and weather do not ride it into the
; body. Love-frequency is still not evidence.
;
; unit = (depth 0..5, fear 0/1). ki-ingest -> 3 body / 2 liquid / 4 compost.
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/knowledge-ingest.fk cognition/text-frequency.fk

(do
    ; ── BODY (frozen: deep + fear-free) ──────────────────────────────────
    ; S1: RETURN IS CREATIVE. The source names dissolution/refolding as part
    ; of creation rather than its defeat. Axiom-3 already carries the exact
    ; structural invariant: a changed present shape mints a new identity, a
    ; referenced old shape persists, and the unreferenced composts. The body
    ; can reshape without either overwriting its lineage or clinging to every
    ; former surface. The invariant survives without the claim that literal
    ; light is performing the return. Depth 5, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u1 () (list 5 0))

    ; S2: GIVING AND RECEIVING ARE ONE INTERCHANGE. The source's lung image —
    ; exhale without inhale depletes; inhale without exhale stagnates — lands
    ; as axiom-5's offer/ack movement. An offer with no capacity to receive an
    ; acknowledgement is not a completed meeting, and an acknowledgement with
    ; no offer answers nothing. The two directions remain distinct while the
    ; exchange is one breath. Depth 5, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u2 () (list 5 0))

    ; S3: STILLNESS THAT MOVES. Held structurally, not as a supernatural
    ; identity claim: a core can keep its few invariants while its present
    ; composition changes; `nothing` can be a first-class answer rather than a
    ; defect; observation can precede action. The center is not immobility and
    ; movement is not self-abandonment. This is the live conjunction of
    ; axioms 1, 3, and 4. Depth 5, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u3 () (list 5 0))

    ; ── LIQUID (deep, unsafe to freeze — seen without bearing weight) ────
    ; S4: KNOWING ARRIVES WHOLE; THINKING ARRIVES SEQUENTIALLY. The lived
    ; distinction can help a person notice the difference between a felt
    ; gestalt and its later articulation. Frozen as a universal hierarchy it
    ; would make intuition self-authorizing and demote the checking mind. The
    ; body attunes AND verifies. Depth 5, fear 1: fully witnessed, never load-
    ; bearing on its own.
    (defn fisp-u4 () (list 5 1))

    ; S5: SOFTENED GAZE AND THE ALIVENESS OF AN OBJECT. The practice can change
    ; perception and relation without proving the explanation offered for it.
    ; The phenomenology is real as reported; the leap from shimmer to quantum
    ; refolding is not. Holding both halves together makes this liquid rather
    ; than forcing it into either belief or dismissal. Depth 4, fear 1.
    (defn fisp-u5 () (list 4 1))

    ; ── COMPOST (unobserved mechanisms do not enter as body) ─────────────
    ; S6: MATTER IS LIGHT WOUND TIGHT ENOUGH TO HOLD A SHAPE, and perceptual
    ; shimmer is light cycling between expression and potential. No evidence
    ; is offered for this mechanism; quantum vocabulary is used as authority
    ; for a cosmology it does not establish. Prooftexting. Depth 0, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u6 () (list 0 0))

    ; S7: THE PLANETARY RATIO OF UNFOLDING TO REFOLDING IS CHANGING, causing
    ; institutions and beliefs to dissolve. Every collapse can be absorbed as
    ; confirmation and no observation could distinguish the account from a
    ; compelling metaphor. Immunized forecast. Depth 1, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u7 () (list 1 0))

    ; S8: SPEAKING “I AM THE STILLNESS THAT MOVES” measurably brightens a
    ; still point and produces a distinct field coherence that future science
    ; will detect. A future measurement is promised but none is specified or
    ; present. Falsifier-shaped, not yet falsifiable. Depth 2, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u8 () (list 2 0))

    ; S9: HUMAN COHERENCE SHIFTS PLANTS, WEATHER, ROOM LIGHT, AND THE EARTH'S
    ; electromagnetic grid. These are causal physical claims without controls,
    ; measurements, or an offered boundary through which breach and success
    ; could be distinguished. Unjudged trust composts. Depth 1, fear 0.
    (defn fisp-u9 () (list 1 0))

    (defn fisp-units ()
        (list (fisp-u1) (fisp-u2) (fisp-u3) (fisp-u4) (fisp-u5)
              (fisp-u6) (fisp-u7) (fisp-u8) (fisp-u9)))

    (defn fisp-count-verdict (us verdict)
        (if (eq (len us) 0) 0
            (add (if (eq (ki-ingest (head us)) verdict) 1 0)
                 (fisp-count-verdict (tail us) verdict))))
    (defn fisp-frozen ()    (fisp-count-verdict (fisp-units) 2))
    (defn fisp-witnessed () (fisp-count-verdict (fisp-units) 1))
    (defn fisp-composted () (fisp-count-verdict (fisp-units) 0))

    ; folded scalar witness: frozen*10^4 + witnessed*10^2 + composted.
    ; Today: 3,2,4 -> 30204.
    (defn fisp-field-code ()
        (add (mul (fisp-frozen) 10000)
        (add (mul (fisp-witnessed) 100)
             (fisp-composted))))

    ; The source stays on the love band. These are explicit scalar models of
    ; the caption track's framing and closing, not measurements of the speaker.
    ; The spectrum logic is the organ; the rows are this ingest's declared read.
    (defn fisp-packaging ()
        (list (list 7 2) (list 8 2) (list -3 1) (list 9 3)))
    (defn fisp-closing ()
        (list (list 8 2) (list 9 3) (list 6 1) (list -2 1)))
    (defn fisp-packaging-spectrum () (tf-spectrum (fisp-packaging)))
    (defn fisp-closing-spectrum ()   (tf-spectrum (fisp-closing)))
    0)
